#. type: Title ==
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/add-remove-entries.adoc:27
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional video"
msgstr "可選影片"

#. type: Title =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit entries"
msgstr "編輯條目"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:5
msgid "All the instructions below will be for working in the GRSciColl part of the https://registry.gbif.org/[GBIF Registry^]. Editing core information, contacts and collection descriptors is possible through the suggestion system but you will need specific permissions to work on identifiers, and master source."
msgstr "以下所有說明均適用於在 https://registry.gbif.org/[GBIF Registry^] 的 GRSciColl 部分進行操作。雖然可透過建議系統編輯核心資訊、聯絡人及收藏描述，但若要處理識別碼及主資料來源，則需具備特定權限。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Editing core information"
msgstr "編輯核心資訊"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:9
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:24
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:36
msgid "Find and click on the entry that you would like to edit."
msgstr "找到並點擊您要編輯的條目。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:10
msgid "Click “suggest” or “edit”."
msgstr "點擊「建議」或「編輯」。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:11
msgid "Make the changes you would like to make."
msgstr "執行您希望進行的變更。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:12
msgid "Click on save (if you are in suggestion mode, you need to provide an email address and comment)."
msgstr "點擊「儲存」（若您處於建議模式，則需提供電子郵件地址及意見）。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:16
msgid "If you notice that some fields are grey and won’t allow you to add any information, that means that the record is connected to a master source. If you would like to update the information for those fields, you have two options:"
msgstr "如果您發現某些欄位呈灰色且無法輸入任何資訊，這表示該記錄已與主資料來源連結。若您想更新這些欄位的資訊，有兩種選擇："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:18
msgid "Edit the information at the source. For that, you need to click on the blue hyperlink at the top of the entry."
msgstr "直接在來源處編輯相關資訊。要進行此操作，您需要點擊該條目頂端的藍色超連結。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:19
msgid "Disconnect the entry from the source. For that, you will need to follow the instructions below."
msgstr "將該條目從來源中移除連結節。為此，您需要依照以下說明操作。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit contact information"
msgstr "編輯聯絡資訊"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:25
msgid "Click on the “Contacts” tab."
msgstr "點擊「聯絡人」分頁。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:26
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:38
msgid "Then you can do one of the following:"
msgstr "接著，您可以執行以下任一項操作："

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:28
msgid "To update an existing contact, click on “view” next to the contact, then the “edit” or “suggest” toggle button in the upper right corner, then save."
msgstr "若要更新現有的聯絡人資料，請點擊該聯絡人旁邊的「檢視」，接著點擊右上角的「編輯」或「建議」，最後點擊「儲存」。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:29
msgid "To create a new contact, click on the “create new” button in the upper right corner and add your contact before saving."
msgstr "若要建立新的聯絡人，請點擊右上角的「建立新聯絡人」按鈕，新增您的聯絡人之後儲存。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:30
msgid "To delete an existing contact, click on “delete” next to the contact and confirm the deletion."
msgstr "若要刪除現有的聯絡人，請點擊該聯絡人旁邊的「刪除」，並確認刪除。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit identifiers"
msgstr "編輯識別碼"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:34
msgid "You will need to be an editor in order to add or remove identifiers."
msgstr "您必須具備編輯者權限，才能新增或移除識別碼。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:37
msgid "Click on the “Identifiers” tab."
msgstr "點選「識別碼」分頁。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:39
msgid "Delete an existing identifier"
msgstr "刪除現有的識別碼"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:40
msgid "Create a new identifier"
msgstr "新增一組新的識別碼"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:42
msgid "When you create a new identifier, you can define it as the primary identifier. The identifier that you would like people to use when citing your institution or collection."
msgstr "建立新識別碼時，您可以將其設定為主識別碼。此識別碼即為您希望他人引用您的機構或館藏時所使用的識別碼。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit, add, delete collection descriptor groups"
msgstr "編輯、新增、刪除館藏描述群組"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:48
msgid "Collection descriptor groups can only be added to collections. Any collection can have several collection descriptor groups."
msgstr "館藏描述群組只能新增至館藏中。任何收藏均可擁有多個館藏描述群組。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:50
msgid "You will need to prepare and format the collection descriptor tables before you upload them in the interface."
msgstr "在將資料上傳至介面之前，您需要先準備並設定館藏描述表的格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:53
msgid "Find and click on the collection that you would like to work with."
msgstr "找到並點擊您想要處理的收藏。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:54
msgid "Click on the “Descriptor group” tab (see the image below)"
msgstr "點擊「館藏描述群組」分頁（參見下圖）"

#. type: Block title
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Descriptor group"
msgstr "描述群組"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "grscicoll::descriptor_group_ui.png"
msgstr "grscicoll::descriptor_group_ui.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:60
msgid "If you would like to add a collection descriptor group:"
msgstr "若您想新增一個「館藏描述」群組："

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:62
msgid "Click Add and fill in the title and description of the descriptor group and choose your CSV file."
msgstr "點擊「新增」，填寫描述群組的標題和說明，然後選擇您的 CSV 檔案。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:63
msgid "Click “add”."
msgstr "點擊「新增」。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:65
msgid "If you would like to delete one, click on the red trash can icon next to the group to delete. To edit them, click on the edit button."
msgstr "若要刪除其中一個群組，請點擊該群組旁邊的紅色垃圾桶圖示。若要編輯群組，請點擊「編輯」按鈕。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add or delete master sources"
msgstr "新增或刪除主來源"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:69
msgid "You will need to be an editor in order to add or remove master source records."
msgstr "您必須具備編輯者權限，才能新增或刪除主來源記錄。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:71
msgid "To add a source:"
msgstr "欲新增來源："

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:73
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:81
msgid "Find and click on the entry that you would like to work with."
msgstr "找到並點擊您想要處理的收藏。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:74
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:82
msgid "Click on the “Master source” tab."
msgstr "點擊「主來源」分頁。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:75
msgid "Click on the “Create new” button."
msgstr "點擊「建立新項目」按鈕。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:76
msgid "Select a type of source in the drop down list"
msgstr "請從下拉式清單中選擇來源類型"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:77
msgid "Enter the identifier corresponding to this entry in the source. For example, if you select a GBIF dataset as the source of a collection, you must provide the UUID of that dataset."
msgstr "請在來源處輸入與此條目對應的識別碼。例如，若您選取 GBIF 資料集作為收藏的來源，則必須提供該資料集的 UUID。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:79
msgid "To delete a source:"
msgstr "欲刪除來源："

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:83
msgid "Click on the “Delete” button (on the same line as the source)."
msgstr "點擊「刪除」按鈕（與來源的位置同一行）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:86
msgid "If you would like to disconnect a collection from Index Herbariorum, please contact us."
msgstr "若您希望將某個收藏從《Index Herbariorum》中移除，請與我們聯絡。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:92
msgid "In this video (03:02), GBIF Data Administrator, Marie Grosjean, describes how to edit entries within GRSciColl."
msgstr "在這段影片（03:02）中，GBIF 資料管理員 Marie Grosjean 說明了如何在 GRSciColl 中編輯條目。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:100
msgid "Go to our https://registry.gbif-uat.org/[TEST registry^] and, without logging in, make the following suggestion:"
msgstr "請前往我們的 https://registry.gbif-uat.org/[測試版註冊系統^]，無需登入即可提出以下建議："

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:102
msgid "Edit the core information of an entry."
msgstr "編輯條目的核心資訊。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:103
msgid "Add a contact point from an entry."
msgstr "從一個條目中新增一個聯絡人。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:104
msgid "Delete a contact point for an entry."
msgstr "從一個條目中刪除一個聯絡人。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/grscicoll/modules/ROOT/pages/edit-entries.adoc:105
msgid "Add a collection descriptor group."
msgstr ""

